@startuml activity-submit-for-approval
' Spec 003 — what a complete listing is, submitting, the free-tier limit (REQ-003-4, -6, -12)
title Submit for approval (REQ-003-4/6/12)

start
:Employer taps "Submit for approval"
(or "Resubmit") on their own listing;
if (Listing is Draft or Rejected?) then (no)
  :Refuse — nothing to submit;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
if (Complete?\nTitle, region, area, salary range,\ntype, description all valid) then (no)
  :Show what is missing;
  note right
    Salary: whole pesos per month,
    minimum ≥ ₱1,000, maximum ≥ minimum.
    Never "negotiable".
  end note
  stop
else (yes)
endif
if (Chosen region still active?) then (no)
  :Ask to choose another region;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
if (Already 3 open listings?\n(Pending + Published)) then (yes)
  :Refuse — explain the limit and
  suggest closing a listing;
  stop
else (no)
endif
:Status → Pending approval;
:Tell the employer: "An admin will
check it before it goes live.";
:Listing appears in the
Admin approval queue (004);
stop
@enduml
